      "created_at": "2019-06-04T22:17:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I saw a reference to this on one of the forums, and despite some Googling couldn't find the answer:</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Someone mentioned an option in the app where they set Twist the Ether to do the same thing (set type of damage, reduce/increase) every time automatically without having to choose.&nbsp; I can't find that option in the iOS app -- is it only on Steam?</p>",
